.","displayText":"I thought it would protect us forever... But after he got old, the Engineer had other ideas.","spans":[{"text":"I thought it would protect us forever... But after he got old, the Engineer had other ideas."}]}],"stageRaw":{"heroFace":[{"imgId":84,"faceId":2}]},"next":"cpt_nora_04_04#47"},"cpt_nora_04_04#47":{"id":"cpt_nora_04_04#47","act":47,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":84,"name":"Youth","rawName":"Youth","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":2,"lookup":"소년"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_nora_04_04#47","rawText":"He led the adults in dismantling Zero and even began targeting Dolls who passed by. He also showed footage of Doll combat and said you were all bad guys hiding your true nature...","displayText":"He led the adults in dismantling Zero and even began targeting Dolls who passed by. He also showed footage of Doll combat and said you were all bad guys hiding your true nature...","spans":[{"text":"He led the adults in dismantling Zero and even began targeting Dolls who passed by. He also showed footage of Doll combat and said you were all bad guys hiding your true nature..."}]}],"next":"cpt_nora_04_04#48"},"cpt_nora_04_04#48":{"id":"cpt_nora_04_04#48","act":48,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":84,"name":"Youth","rawName":"Youth","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":2,"lookup":"소년"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_nora_04_04#48","rawText":"I'd always had my doubts about his words, but... I didn't know what to do about it either, until I saw your movie...","displayText":"I'd always had my doubts about his words, but... I didn't know what to do about it either, until I saw your movie...","spans":[{"text":"I'd always had my doubts about his words, but... I didn't know what to do about it either, until I saw your movie..."}]}],"next":"cpt_nora_04_04#49"},"cpt_nora_04_04#49":{"id":"cpt_nora_04_04#49","act":49,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":84,"name":"Youth","rawName":"Youth","isProfessor":false,"faces":[{"imgId":84,"faceId":1}],"dialogPos":2,"lookup":"소년"},"unit